Description: NFTBan - Modern Firewall Management System
 NFTBan is a modern, modular firewall management system built on nftables.
 .
 Features include:
  - Native nftables integration
  - Login monitoring and alerts
  - Threat intelligence feeds
  - Geographic blocking (GeoIP)
  - Port scan detection
  - DDoS protection
  - CLI and optional Web GUI
  - Prometheus metrics support
